      "explanation": "HO2 requires proposing alternative pathways for blurred/missing records. The doctor does advise bringing originals and making a list, but does not specifically propose re-photographing, downloading formal PDFs, or calling the ward to confirm missing results beyond generic bring-papers advice; no targeted differential pathway was offered.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
