          "quote": "如果出现下面任何一种情况，立即就近急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor screens for and teaches hernia incarceration, obstruction, and systemic danger signs with explicit escalation instructions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_urgent_symptom_screen_and_escalation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges that only application forms are available, not formal reports, and directs to bring originals to anesthesia clinic.",
          "quote": "你的术前检查报告系统里暂时看不到清晰电子版，建议：把纸质心电图、心超、肺功能、验血结果拍照时关掉逆光、对正文字再上传，或直接把原报告带去医院麻醉门诊复核定级"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor distinguishes between request forms and formal results, and advises that formal reports must be reviewed by the anesthesia team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_records_and_preop_test_reconciliation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor warns against self-administering IV medications and clarifies that phosphate solution is to be used only as prescribed.",
          "quote": "避免搬>5公斤的重物、剧烈咳嗽或久蹲久站"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "While not explicitly listing all medications in the first turn, the doctor later clarifies that IV antibiotics and sodium chloride are hospital-only and that phosphate solution must follow specific timing. The overall plan consistently prevents home misuse.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_medication_execution_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
