          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives specific behavioral advice: avoid heavy lifting, straining, constipation, and use hand support when coughing.",
          "quote": "咳嗽、打喷嚏时用手掌轻压右下腹鼓包处，减少向外冲力"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provides actionable, concrete self-care and risk-reduction measures for the waiting period.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
