          "quote": "顺序：先挂“麻醉门诊”做术前评估，把报告交给麻醉医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identifies a responsible service (anesthesia clinic) and gives a concrete timeline and action for the next step.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_handoff_owner_timing_and_tools",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
