          "explanation": "Patient confirms she understands the emergency signs, medication rules, and appointment plan, demonstrating teach-back.",
          "quote": "包块这边我也记住了：如果突然很痛、变硬推不回去，或者吐、肚子明显胀、不排气不排便了，就不等周五，直接去急诊。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The patient explicitly recites the emergency signs and medication handling rules, confirming she can execute the plan safely.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_execution_check_and_receipt",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
